<title>ITALY: Italian electricity consumption slips in November.</title>
<headline>Italian electricity consumption slips in November.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian electricity consumption fell 2.4 percent year-on-year in November, utility company Enel said in provisional data released on Thursday.</p>
<p>In the first 11 months of the year, electricity consumption rose 0.6 percent compared with the same period last year, Enel said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
